# Line endings are load-bearing in this repo.
#
# The 11 embedded scripts must stay LF-only and pure ASCII: Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads a
# .ps1 without a BOM as ANSI, and src/Tests.ps1 asserts both properties. With core.autocrlf
# enabled git would rewrite them as CRLF on the next checkout and the test would fail, so the
# rule is pinned here rather than left to a per-machine setting.
*.ps1   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.cs    text eol=lf
*.iss   text eol=crlf
*.exe   binary
